
# ============================================================
# Yekara - Transient Window Rules
# ============================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Initial transient handling
# ------------------------------------------------------------

DestroyFunc FuncApplyTransientRules
AddToFunc   FuncApplyTransientRules
+ I ThisWindow (Transient) WindowStyle PositionPlacement Center, FixedPosition, FixedSize
+ I ThisWindow (Transient) PlaceAgain Center


DestroyModuleConfig FE-TransientRules: *
*FE-TransientRules: add_window FuncApplyTransientRules


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep transients centered when their geometry changes
# ------------------------------------------------------------

DestroyFunc FuncRecenterTransient
AddToFunc   FuncRecenterTransient
+ I ThisWindow (Transient) PlaceAgain Center


DestroyModuleConfig FE-TransientRecenter: *
*FE-TransientRecenter: add_window       FuncRecenterTransient


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Start FvwmEvent modules
# ------------------------------------------------------------

AddToFunc StartFunction
+ I Module FvwmEvent FE-TransientRules
+ I Module FvwmEvent FE-TransientRecenter


